 ### Edge Cases and Pitfalls
-- **Coherence Loss**: SIMD efficiency is tied to ray coherence. It is lost as soon as some rays traverse a full cell while others pass through an empty one [S1, unofficial][S2, unofficial].
-- **Precision**: Not given in the sources.
