 ## Operating characteristics
 - **Time Complexity**: Depends on the number of intersection candidates and the number of high-workload rays [S2, unofficial].
-- **Memory Complexity**: Uses shared memory for the buffer and reduction arrays. The buffer holds at most 20 entries; if more than 20 high-workload rays exist, the algorithm falls back to the standard routine instead of using the buffer [S1, unofficial][S2, unofficial].
